        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo slaqwara nari malé ti'ít baraá yaamaá Gatiro. Baraá ayaadae heeko wák i deer, ku xatl-hhoó'. Umuú dako ditsa' ngi kon lahhoó', nee ditsaá ya'aawós a lahhoó' umuúqo yaaeero, ditsaawós sleémeero a mibeeri tsár nee tsiyáhh. Heewí oo xwaylár mukdá' dirén, tledaadét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
